1 BIRT
2 DATE 5 DEC 1875
2 PLAC Bameskov, Tranekær sogn,Langeland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 13 MAR 1946
2 PLAC Albuquerque, Bernalillo, New Mexico, USA
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tvilling.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han kom til USA i 1900. Gift 10. dec. 1913 i Albuquerque, Bernalillo, New Mexico, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT I 1920 bor han i eget hus North Eight Street 1035 i Old Albuquerque, Bernalillo, New Mexico, USA. Beskæftigelse: Freight handler for railroad.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1930 er han agent, Railroad
2 CONT
2 CONT 1940 bor han i samme by og gade men nu nr. 1213. Beskæftigelse Packer in Indian Curio Store
2 CONT
2 CONT Ved død er han news agent:
2 CONT
2 CONT Dato: 14. mar. 1846  	Udgivelse:	Albuquerque journal, New Mexico, United States of America, side 3
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Hein, 70, Dies; Resident 34 Years.  Peter Hein,. Fred Harvey news agent who had lived In Albuquerque 34 years, died Wednesday morning at his home, 1213 "North Third, at the age of 70.- Family survivors are his wife, three so
2 CONC ns, L. A., Los Angeles; Fred and Morris, Albuquerque; a daughter, Mrs. Elsie Adams, Albuquerque: two grandchildren, and two sisters in Denmark. He was a member of St. Paul Lulheran Church. The Rev. Saker will conduct funeral survi
2 CONC ces Friday at 2 p.m. from the French-Fitzgerald Chapel in the Garden"
