1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gift som 16-årig med Harry Fidela Adams, skilt fra Harry Fidela Adams 1. gang før 1940, gift igen 9.6.1948 i Valencia og skilt igen 2. gang 12.12.1955 i Albuquerque.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Jun. 14, 1914 Albuquerque, Bernalillo County, New Mexico, USA Death: 	Jun. 9, 2010 Lorenzo, Crosby County, Texas, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Graveside services for Elsie Anina Borth, 95, of Lorenzo will be held at 10:00 AM Friday, June 11, 2010 at the Lorenzo Cemetery with Rev. Jerry Golden officiating. Burial is under direction of Adams Funeral Home of Lorenzo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elsie passed away Wednesday, June 9, 2010 at her Lorenzo residence. She was born June 14, 1914 in Albuquerque, New Mexico to the late Nickolas and Anna (Anderson) Hein. She married John Borth February 12, 1969 in Albuquerque. He p
2 CONC receded her in death August 26, 1985. She was a homemaker and a member of the Lorenzo First Baptist Church. She moved to Lorenzo in 1970 from Alamogordo, New Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is preceded in death by a son, George Borth, a grandson, Owen Chastain and by two brothers Fred Hein and Morris Hein.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by a daughter, Elsie Marie Chastain of Lorenzo, a great grandson, Shawn Chastain and two great great grandsons, Garrett Chastain and Tori Chastain. 
