2 CONT Ved død: HEIN -- Fred C. Hein, 84, a lifetime resident of New Mexico, died Monday, May 3, 2004. He is survived by his brother, Morris Hein and wife, Wilma of Albuquerque; sister, Elsie Borth of Lorenzo, TX; a special niece, Elsie 
2 CONC Marie Chastain of Lorenzo, TX and several other nieces, nephews and grand nieces and grand nephews. His wife Peggy Hein preceded him in death. Mr. Hein was a member of St. Paul Lutheran Church. He was a US Army veteran US Army vet
2 CONC eran of WWII, receiving the Bronze Star medal for heroism. Graveside services will be held at 2:00 p.m., Thursday, May 6, 2004 at Vista Verde Memorial Park, 4310 Sara Rd, Rio Rancho with Pastor Patricia Holman, officiating. Should
2 CONC  friends desire memorial contributions may be made to the Alzheimer's Association, 8100 Mountain Rd, NE, Suite 102, Albuquerque, NM 87110. French Mortuary 1111 University Blvd. NE 843-6333 Left-red
