2 CONC of Las Vegas, NV; seven grandchildren; 11 great-grandchildren; sister, Elsie Borth of Lorenzo, TX; and niece, Elsie Marie Chastine of Lorenzo, TX. Services will be held at 10:00 a.m. on Tuesday, March 24, 2009 at French Mortuary -
2 CONC  University Chapel, 1111 University NE. Interment will follow at Sunset Memorial Park, 924 Menaul NE. Friends may visit French Mortuary - University Chapel from 5:00 p.m. until 7:00 p.m. on Monday, March 23, 2009. In lieu of flowe
2 CONC rs, memorial contributions should be made to University Heights United Methodist Church, 2210 Silver SE, 87106, where Morris was a member. Please visit our online guestbook for Morris at RememberTheirStory.com
