1 NAME Laura /Uhrenholt/
2 GIVN Laura
2 SURN Uhrenholt
2 _MARNM Uhrenholt
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 DEC 1880
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hellum i Torup Sogn, Hellum herred, Aalborg Amt
1 DEAT
