2 CONT
2 CONT John was the son of Russian immigrants Daniel Borth and Dorothea Steinpreis. Identified siblings were Lillian "Lillie", Rinehold "Ronald", Rachel Louise, Rosella "Rosa" Fay, Hilda Lydia, and Milton J.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 23 Oct 1942, John Borth (B: ~1908, Oklahoma) enlisted as a Private in the US Army in Santa Fe, New Mexico. He was recorded as 5 feet 7 inches, 146 pounds, single, a construction worker, and a resident of Bernalillo County. John
2 CONC  served in the Army from 6 Nov 1942 to 11 Oct 1945.
